---
const faqs = [
  ["Who are you?", "A small web design team founded by Yash, a UX designer with more than 4 years of experience designing websites and apps. We're new as a studio. That's why the price is low and our examples are concept projects."],
  ["Who will I talk to?", "Yash, our founder, leads every project. You have one point of contact from the first email to the handover."],
  ["How can it be this fast?", "The 5-day offer covers one kind of website: a small site for a local business. That keeps the plan simple. We also use AI tools for the routine building work, so our time goes into the design."],
  ["What if I don't like it?", "You see the full design before you pay the second half, and 2 rounds of changes are included."],
  ["How do I pay?", "We send an invoice. You pay half before we start and half when you approve the finished site."],
  ["Who looks after the site later?", "You do. We hand everything over with a short video that shows how to change the text and photos."],
  ["Where are you based?", "In India. We work with business owners abroad by email and video call."],
];
---
<section class="section" id="questions">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="head">
      <h2 class="h2" data-reveal>Questions you might have.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="faq">
      {faqs.map(([q, a]) => (
        <details>
          <summary>{q}</summary>
          <p>{a}</p>
        </details>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
